export const PLAIN_COPY = Object.freeze({"dayMaster":{"zh":{"wood":{"yang":"你習慣往前開路，想到就先動，缺點是收尾容易放著。","yin":"你習慣繞過阻礙也要達成，耐得久，但容易把事情悶在心裡。"},"fire":{"yang":"你習慣把想法講出來、讓人看見，熱度高，但來得快去得也快。","yin":"你習慣在小範圍裡持續發光，照顧得細，但容易燒自己。"},"earth":{"yang":"你習慣穩住場面、承接別人，可靠，但會把事情都扛到自己身上。","yin":"你習慣默默把細節補好，體貼，但不容易開口要東西。"},"metal":{"yang":"你習慣快速取捨、切掉雜訊，果斷，但容易顯得太硬。","yin":"你習慣把事情做得精準乾淨，講究，但容易對自己和別人太嚴。"},"water":{"yang":"你習慣變通、找別人沒走過的路，靈活，但容易同時開太多條線。","yin":"你習慣先想透再動，想得深，但容易想太久錯過時機。"}},"en":{"wood":{"yang":"You clear the way and act on ideas fast. Finishing is where you tend to drift.","yin":"You work around obstacles and keep at it, but tend to keep things bottled up."},"fire":{"yang":"You say what you think and like to be seen. Your energy runs hot, then cools fast.","yin":"You glow steadily for a few people and look after details, often at your own expense."},"earth":{"yang":"You steady the room and support others. You're reliable, but end up carrying everything.","yin":"You quietly take care of the details and rarely ask for anything in return."},"metal":{"yang":"You cut through the noise and decide fast, which can come across as harsh.","yin":"You do things precisely and cleanly, but can be too strict with yourself and others."},"water":{"yang":"You adapt and find paths others miss, but tend to juggle too many at once.","yin":"You think things through before you act, sometimes so long the moment passes."}}},"contexts":{"zh":{"peer":{"intimacy":"你把伴侶當成同輩，有話直說、不太想分上下。好處是對等，代價是容易變成互相較勁。","work":"你習慣跟人並肩做事，也常和人撞到同一塊。合作順的時候很快，卡住時容易僵持。","later":"你私下仍需要同伴，一個人久了會悶。往後要留意的是別把關係都處成競爭。"},"output":{"intimacy":"你用「做」來表達愛：記得事情、張羅細節。但你不太說出口，對方不一定收得到。","work":"你靠做出東西和講出想法推進，成果留得下。代價是容易過勞，也容易跟規矩頂撞。","later":"你私下停不下來，總想再做一點。往後的功課是允許自己什麼都不產出。"},"wealth":{"intimacy":"你在關係裡重實際：會安排、會給，也期待對方同樣務實。熱絡但容易分心。","work":"你看得到機會也抓得住，適合靈活調度的位置。缺點是同時開太多條線。","later":"你往後會持續接觸新機會。要注意的是取捨，不是所有的機會都該接。"},"officer":{"intimacy":"你在關係裡守規矩、負責任，但也容易把對方的期待扛成壓力。","work":"你長期被要求推著走，做得紮實。代價是喘不過氣，也容易不敢拒絕。","later":"你往後仍會替人扛事。功課是把「應該」換成「我選擇」。"},"resource":{"intimacy":"你在關係裡傾向照顧與被照顧，溫和。但容易默默忍讓，不開口要東西。","work":"你靠累積和學習站穩，底子厚。缺點是想得久、動得慢。","later":"你往後有人也有知識支撐。要留意的是別把安穩過成不動。"}},"en":{"peer":{"intimacy":"You treat a partner as an equal and speak plainly. That keeps things fair, but it can turn into rivalry.","work":"You work side by side with people and often bump into them. It's fast when it flows and stubborn when it stalls.","later":"You still need company in private life. Watch that closeness doesn't turn into competition."},"output":{"intimacy":"You show love by doing: remembering things, handling details. You rarely say it, so it may not land.","work":"You move things forward by making and speaking up. The results last, but you can burn out and clash with rules.","later":"You can't sit still, even in private. The practice is letting yourself make nothing at all."},"wealth":{"intimacy":"You're practical in love: you plan and provide, and expect the same back. Warm, but easily distracted.","work":"You spot chances and take them, so flexible roles suit you. The catch is juggling too many at once.","later":"New chances keep coming your way. The skill is choosing, not saying yes to all of them."},"officer":{"intimacy":"You're dutiful in relationships, but you can take a partner’s expectations on as pressure.","work":"Demands keep pushing you, and your work is solid. The cost is feeling stretched and finding it hard to say no.","later":"You'll keep carrying things for others. The practice is turning “should” into “I choose”."},"resource":{"intimacy":"You tend to care for others and be cared for, gently. But you often give way quietly instead of asking.","work":"You find your footing through steady study. Your base is deep, but you're slow to move.","later":"People and knowledge hold you up. Watch that feeling settled doesn't turn into standing still."}}},"themeTails":{"zh":{"peer":{"personality":"你最怕被壓著走，所以遇到命令式的說法會自動抗拒。想說服你，得先把你當成平等的一方。","love":"吵架時你不太退讓，因為退讓對你等於輸。練習的方法是把「誰對」換成「我們要什麼」。","work":"你適合有自主權的位置。被微管理時你的效率會掉一半，那不是態度問題，是結構不合。"},"output":{"personality":"你腦袋停不下來，想法比時間多。沒有產出時你會焦躁，那是你確認自己還活著的方式。","love":"你需要一個欣賞你作品的人，不是一個只要你陪的人。被「你怎麼都在忙」否定時最傷。","work":"你適合能端出成品的工作。純執行、看不到成果的位置會把你磨掉。"},"wealth":{"personality":"你對「有沒有用」很敏感，討厭空談。別人覺得你現實，其實你只是不想浪費時間。","love":"你用資源表達在乎——請客、送東西、幫忙解決。對方若要的是陪伴，你們會錯過彼此。","work":"你適合接觸人與機會的位置。關在後台久了，你會覺得自己在枯掉。"},"officer":{"personality":"你對「應該」很敏感，標準高，先要求自己。放鬆對你來說需要練習，不是天生會的。","love":"你把關係當責任在經營，穩定可靠。但對方可能感覺不到被愛，只感覺到被安排。","work":"你適合責任清楚的位置。模糊的分工會讓你把別人的事也扛起來。"},"resource":{"personality":"你需要先懂才敢動，所以看起來慢。但你一旦動，通常不會回頭。","love":"你照顧人很自然，卻不太開口要。久了容易累積「我都為你」的怨。練習是直接說出需求。","work":"你適合需要累積的專業。常換跑道會讓你一直停在入門，發揮不出來。"}},"en":{"peer":{"personality":"Being ordered around makes you push back. To win you over, people have to treat you as an equal.","love":"You rarely back down in a fight, because it feels like losing. Try swapping “who’s right” for “what do we want”.","work":"You need room to work your own way. Micromanaging cuts your output in half. That's a poor fit, not a bad attitude."},"output":{"personality":"Your mind never stops. When you're not making something you get restless. Making things is how you feel alive.","love":"You need someone who appreciates what you make, not just someone who wants your time.","work":"You do well where you can show finished work. Pure execution, with no visible results, wears you down."},"wealth":{"personality":"You care a lot about whether something is useful, and you can't stand empty talk.","love":"You show you care by paying, giving, and fixing things. If they want your company instead, you'll miss each other.","work":"You need to be out among people and chances. Kept behind the scenes, you wither."},"officer":{"personality":"You notice every “should” and hold yourself to it first. Relaxing takes practice for you.","love":"You treat a relationship as a responsibility. You're reliable, but it can feel more like being managed than loved.","work":"You need clear responsibilities. When roles are vague, you end up doing other people’s work."},"resource":{"personality":"You need to understand before you act, so you can look slow. But once you move, you rarely turn back.","love":"Caring for others comes naturally, but you rarely ask for anything, until resentment builds. The practice is saying what you need.","work":"You do well in fields where skill builds over time. Switching tracks often keeps you stuck as a beginner."}}},"cycles":{"zh":{"peer":"這十年身邊的人多，合作與競爭都會變明顯。","output":"這十年你會一直在做東西、表達自己，成果留得下，也比較耗。","wealth":"這十年機會與資源比較流動，掌握得到，也容易分散。","officer":"這十年責任與要求會變重，有結構，也會比較喘。","resource":"這十年支撐比較足，適合吸收與學習，行動力要自己顧。"},"en":{"peer":"A decade with lots of people around. Both teamwork and competition become more visible.","output":"A decade of making things and expressing yourself. The results last, but it takes a lot out of you.","wealth":"A decade where chances and resources move around. They're within reach, but easy to spread thin.","officer":"A decade of heavier duties and demands. There's more structure, and less room to breathe.","resource":"A decade with solid support. It suits taking things in and learning, but keep your own drive going."}},"years":{"zh":{"peer":"這一年同輩的事多，合夥、同事、朋友都會佔掉你的時間。","rob":"這一年容易和人爭同一塊，談條件前先把底線寫下來。","eatingGod":"這一年適合慢慢做出一個東西，不急著給人看也沒關係。","hurtingOfficer":"這一年你會很想說實話、很想改規則，講之前先想一下場合。","indirectWealth":"這一年機會來得零散，抓得到但留不住，挑一兩件做就好。","directWealth":"這一年適合把固定的收入與安排穩下來，不要急著換跑道。","sevenKillings":"這一年壓力比較直接，被推著走。先顧好睡眠與期限，其他再說。","directOfficer":"這一年責任會找上你，位置可能變重。接之前先問清楚範圍。","indirectResource":"這一年適合自己讀、自己想，但別想太久不動。","directResource":"這一年會有人幫你、有資源進來，記得把學到的用出去。"},"en":{"peer":"A year full of peers. Partners, coworkers, and friends take up a lot of your time.","rob":"A year when you may compete with others for the same thing. Write down your limits before you negotiate.","eatingGod":"A year for slowly making something. It's fine not to show anyone yet.","hurtingOfficer":"A year when you want to speak your mind and change the rules. Think about the setting first.","indirectWealth":"A year of scattered chances. They're easy to catch but hard to keep, so pick one or two.","directWealth":"A year to settle your regular income and routines instead of rushing to switch tracks.","sevenKillings":"A year of direct pressure that pushes you along. Look after your sleep and deadlines first.","directOfficer":"A year when responsibility finds you. Ask what it covers before you say yes.","indirectResource":"A year for reading and thinking on your own. Just don't think so long you never act.","directResource":"A year when help and resources come in. Put what you learn to use."}},"homework":{"zh":{"peer":"跟人並肩或較勁","output":"做東西與表達","wealth":"抓機會與調度資源","officer":"扛責任與守規矩","resource":"吸收與依靠支持"},"en":{"peer":"working alongside or against others","output":"making and expressing","wealth":"catching chances and moving resources","officer":"carrying duty and rules","resource":"absorbing and leaning on support"}}});
